cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived data, please cite the article below."
title: "Everything is memory? A connectome-based falsification test of attractor inertia as a unifying axis of autistic, Alzheimer and parkinsonian brain dynamics"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a connectome-based falsification test of whether
  motif-gated attractor inertia (consolidation gain g) and stochastic noise
  tolerance (sigma) unify neurotypical, autistic, Alzheimer and parkinsonian
  brain dynamics, and resolution of their disjoint coordinates in the space of
  coupling budget (K), conduction velocity (v), focal sensorimotor locus (g_SM)
  and noise (sigma).
type: software
